---
---

<section class="bg-gray-900 text-white border-b-2 border-gray-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-12">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-500 mb-2">Expert Curators</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">Audited by operators.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-400 font-medium text-base leading-relaxed max-w-sm lg:mb-2">
        Every tool passes an infrastructure-level audit. Our curators run deployments, review licenses, and verify claims.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="lg:col-span-1 bg-white border-2 border-gray-900 p-6 text-gray-900">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary-100 border-2 border-primary-500 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-black mb-4">JM</div>
        <p class="font-black text-gray-900 text-base">Joanna M.</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold mb-4">Infrastructure Architect, ex-HashiCorp</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">
          "We treat each tool as if we're deploying it on a client's air-gapped cluster. If it phones home, it's out."
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t-2 border-gray-900">
          <span class="text-xs font-black text-gray-900 uppercase tracking-wider">15 years in SRE</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-3 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-900 p-5 text-gray-900 transition-all duration-300 ease-out-expo hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-card-hover">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-primary-100 border-2 border-primary-500 text-primary-700 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider">Deep Dive</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-black text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2">Runtime Audit</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed mb-4">Verified outbound calls, network sandbox escapes, and dependency supply chain.</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900">1,200+ <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold">runtimes tested</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-900 p-5 text-gray-900 transition-all duration-300 ease-out-expo hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-card-hover">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-primary-100 border-2 border-primary-500 text-primary-700 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider">Verification</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-black text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2">License Compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed mb-4">Every tool's license, dependency licenses, and copyleft boundaries reviewed by legal ops.</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900">98.5% <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold">commercial-safe</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-900 p-5 text-gray-900 transition-all duration-300 ease-out-expo hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-card-hover">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-primary-100 border-2 border-primary-500 text-primary-700 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider">Benchmark</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-black text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2">Hardware Profiling</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed mb-4">RAM, GPU, and disk benchmarks tested on standard infrastructure configurations.</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900">47 <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold">hardware configs</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
